    "title": "12/24 Athletes of the Week - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Logan Whaley ,\n1 hours ago PADUCAH, Ky. -- Christian Fellowship's Elijah Grigg and McCracken County's Mason Clements were named this week's WPSD/Biokinetics Athletes of the Week. In four games this week, Grigg had stat lines of 11 points/10 rebounds, 31 points/9 rebounds, 31 points/8 rebounds and 24 points in wins over CCA, Fort Campbell, Dresden and Heritage. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
